I run a service that sends a tagged test lead through each client site's form every day and confirms it reaches the inbox or CRM. It costs $8 per site per month.

Would a free 30-day check on your sites be useful?

\\[Your name\\]  
\\[Mailing address\\]  
\\[Phone or website\\]  
\\[Unsubscribe line\\]

#### Email 2: Proof your maintenance retainer works

Hi \\[First name\\],

Your care plans promise the site keeps working. A monthly report showing every client's lead path was tested and delivered is hard proof of that.

We test each form daily and send you the report. Happy to set it up free on a few sites.

\\[Your name\\]  
\\[Mailing address\\]  
\\[Phone or website\\]  
\\[Unsubscribe line\\]

#### Email 3: The failure your uptime monitor can't see

Hi \\[First name\\],

Uptime monitors check that a page loads. They don't check that a submitted lead reaches your client. That gap is where leads silently disappear after SMTP or CRM changes.

We close it with a daily end-to-end test per site. Worth a 15-minute call?

\\[Your name\\]  
\\[Mailing address\\]  
\\[Phone or website\\]  
\\[Unsubscribe line\\]

### Follow-ups

#### Follow-up 1: Re: client form checks

Hi \\[First name\\], just following up. If it helps, I can run one free check on your three busiest client sites and send you the result.

\\[Your name\\]  
\\[Mailing address\\]  
\\[Phone or website\\]  
\\[Unsubscribe line\\]

#### Follow-up 2: Closing the loop

Hi \\[First name\\], I won't keep emailing. If silent form failures ever become a headache, reply and I'll set up a free pilot.

\\[Your name\\]  
\\[Mailing address\\]  
\\[Phone or website\\]  
\\[Unsubscribe line\\]

### Call script

Open: ask how many client sites they maintain and how they find out when a form stops delivering. Probe: last time a client complained about missing enquiries, how long it took to notice. Offer: free 30-day pilot on their sites with a daily delivery test and an end-of-month report. Close: book the pilot setup call.

### Objections

- **We already have uptime monitoring.**: Uptime confirms the page loads; this confirms the lead arrives. They catch different failures.
- **Our forms rarely break.**: The pilot is free, so you lose nothing if it finds nothing, and you get a report to show clients either way.

### Pricing copy

$8 per monitored site per month. Daily end-to-end lead tests, instant alerts when a form stops delivering, and a monthly per-client proof report. No setup fee, cancel anytime.

## Score

### AI scores

_Not scored yet._
